# [DD-13b.W23.1] RAGGED PROSE INSIDE A REGION IS LEGAL, and its RELATIVE
# indentation survives. §1.6.1a candidate (3), the second narrowing S3
# avoids, and the fixture S-M1 named as owed: no fixture carried a ragged
# prose body before. The dedent strips the FIRST continuation line's
# indent from every line, so a deeper line keeps the difference.
description |
  level one
    level two, deeper
  level one again

pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
